:59.331669,"lon":18.083791},{"name":"Nybroplan","lat":59.332843,"lon":18.076242,"story":"Vid Nybroplan ligger Dramaten, Kungliga Dramatiska teatern, invigd 1908. Härifrån börjar Strandvägen, med sina pampiga sekelskifteshus längs vattnet, och från Nybrokajen går båtar ut i skärgården.","tips":[["Strandvägen, promenad längs vattnet","2 min"],["Båtar från Nybrokajen","2 min"]],"dur":12.5,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Norrmalm%2C_Stockholm%2C_Sweden_-_panoramio_%2841%29.jpg/1280px-Norrmalm%2C_Stockholm%2C_Sweden_-_panoramio_%2841%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Алексей Решетников","license":"CC BY 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Norrmalm,_Stockholm,_Sweden_-_panoramio_(41).jpg","title":"Norrmalm, Stockholm, Sweden","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Sweden_-_Stockholm_-_panoramio_%2823%29.jpg/1280px-Sweden_-_Stockholm_-_panoramio_%2823%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"randreu","license":"CC BY 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sweden_-_Stockholm_-_panoramio_(23).jpg","title":"Sweden - Stockholm","near":true},{"src":"https://pub.raa.se/dokumentation/40c8b182-f89b-41d4-9376-5386108120ab/visning/1","credit":"Claesson, Erik","license":"Public domain","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/raa/dokumentation/html/40c8b182-f89b-41d4-9376-5386108120ab","title":"Nybroplan/Birgerjarlsgatan, Stockholm City","old":true,"year":1966,"museum":"Riksantikvarieämbetet"},{"src":"https://pub.raa.se/dokumentation/ea4ba032-18b9-48b6-8228-6d2c117fa83a/visning/1","credit":"Claesson, Erik","license":"Public domain","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/raa/dokumentation/html/ea4ba032-18b9-48b6-8228-6d2c117fa83a","title":"Nybroplan mot Hötorgscity - City","old":true,"year":1967,"museum":"Riksantikvarieämbetet"}],"audio":"audio/piper/db93ec2f482d16a4.mp3"},{"name":"Kungsträdgården","lat":59.332795,"lon":18.070176,"story":"Kungsträdgården var från början kungens köksträdgård. I dag är den en av stadens mest omtyckta parker, och på våren blommar körsbärsträden här i rosa och vitt.","tips":[["Kungsträdgården","1 min"],["Kungliga Operan","4 min"]],"dur":9.2,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/K%C3%B6rsb%C3%A4rsblom_i_Kungstr%C3%A4dg%C3%A5rden_03.JPG/1280px-K%C3%B6rsb%C3%A4rsblom_i_Kungstr%C3%A4dg%C3%A5rden_03.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"I99pema","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:K%C3%B6rsb%C3%A4rsblom_i_Kungstr%C3%A4dg%C3%A5rden_03.JPG","title":"Körsbärsblom i Kungsträdgården This is a photo of a building (without protection) in Sweden, number ","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Cargo_tricycle_in_Stockholm.jpg/1280px-Cargo_tricycle_in_Stockholm.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Maasaak","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cargo_tricycle_in_Stockholm.jpg","title":"Cargo tricycle in Stockholm (Sweden)","near":true},{"src":"https://pub.raa.se/dokumentation/2dd0d24b-a1a2-44d1-86f6-c051d3824f51/visning/1","credit":"Rosenberg, Carl Gustaf","license":"Public domain","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/raa/dokumentation/html/2dd0d24b-a1a2-44d1-86f6-c051d3824f51","title":"Utsikt mot Slottet från Kungsträdgården","old":true,"year":1922,"museum":"Riksantikvarieämbetet"},{"src":"https://pub.raa.se/dokumentation/ee5643ae-c47e-4579-9543-099f026163cb/visning/1","credit":"Claesson, Erik","license":"Public domain","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/raa/dokumentation/html/ee5643ae-c47e-4579-9543-099f026163cb","title":"Kungsträdgården - City","old":true,"year":1967,"museum":"Riksantikvarieämbetet"}],"audio":"audio/piper/7c7439e25bb3acdc.mp3"},{"name":"T-Centralen","lat":59.332203,"lon":18.062075,"story":"Snart är vi framme vid ändhållplatsen T-Centralen. Under gatorna klättrar blå rankor och blad över grottväggarna på blå linjens perronger. Konstnären Per Olof Ultvedt målade dem 1975, och bland slingorna syns silhuetter av arbetarna som byggde stationen. Ultvedt var annars mest känd för sina mekaniska skulpturer och var med och skapade den berömda installationen Hon – en katedral 1966. Tack för att du åkte med!","tips":[],"dur":25.0,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Enkoping_%285721525533%29.jpg/1280px-Enkoping_%285721525533%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Hugh Llewelyn","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Enkoping_(5721525533).jpg","title":"Stockholm steam ferry \"Enkoping\" in the harbour, 6/10.","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Stockholm_%288273722196%29.jpg/1280px-Stockholm_%288273722196%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Guillaume Speurt from Vilnius, Lithuania","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stockholm_(8273722196).jpg","title":"Skeppsbron in Stockholm in Sweden","near":true},{"src":"https://pub.raa.se/dokumentation/66be6c92-9542-4c20-a150-540f5fcbb75c/visning/1","credit":"Nilsson, Pål-Nils","license":"Public domain","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/raa/dokumentation/html/66be6c92-9542-4c20-a150-540f5fcbb75c","title":"Sergels torg och T-centralen byggs. Rivningar. City","old":true,"year":1953,"museum":"Riksantikvarieämbetet"}],"audio":"audio/piper/80dbadd0b99b0e99.mp3"}],"looks":[{"id":"gronalund","lat":59.3233,"lon":18.0966,"r":260,"text":"Till vänster ligger Gröna Lund, Sveriges äldsta nöjespark.","dur":4.5,"audio":"audio/piper/f3e552f5474f7ef0.mp3"}],"from":"Waldemarsudde","to":"T-Centralen","variant":"Mot T-Centralen","color":["#